#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Evidence-first research pack for the former Honjo Army Clothing Depot.

This script intentionally fails closed.  It may create an exploratory geometric
fit and modern-feature constraint envelope, but it never creates a verified
historical boundary and never changes scores or rankings.
"""
